<HeadContent><title>Panel de Aprobación - Bitácora KM</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css"></HeadContent>
<main class="shell"><div class="topbar no-print"><div class="brand"><a href="/" class="mark">NC</a><div><h1>Panel de Aprobación</h1><p>Revisión, GPS e impresión de bitácoras</p></div></div><div class="nav" data-auth-nav><a class="btn ghost" href="/accesos.html">Accesos</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/">Inicio</a><button id="printBtn" class="btn ghost">Imprimir</button><button id="csvBtn" class="btn ghost">CSV</button></div></div><section class="card"><div class="print-header"><h1>BITÁCORA DE RECORRIDO POR KILÓMETRO</h1><p id="printMeta"></p></div><div class="filters no-print"><div class="field wide"><label for="company">Empresa</label><select id="company"><option value="blokon">BLOKON</option><option value="conaser">CONASER</option><option value="security">NEW CENTURY SECURITY</option><option value="newcentury">NEW CENTURY</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="employee">Colaborador</label><select id="employee"><option value="">Todos</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="from">Desde</label><input id="from" type="date"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">Hasta</label><input id="to" type="date"></div><button id="searchBtn" class="btn primary">Consultar</button></div><div class="summary-grid"><div class="metric"><span>Gestiones</span><strong id="mCount">0</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>KM odómetro</span><strong id="mKm">0</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>KM GPS</span><strong id="mGps">0</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Aprobadas</span><strong id="mApproved">0</strong></div><div class="metric"><span>Revisar</span><strong id="mReview">0</strong></div></div><p id="gpsComparisonStatus" class="hint no-print" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="table-wrap km-table-scroll review-table-scroll"><table class="audit-table"><thead id="comparisonHead"></thead><tbody id="rows"><tr><td colspan="13" class="empty">Seleccione los filtros y consulte.</td></tr></tbody><tfoot id="comparisonTotals" hidden></tfoot></table></div><p id="totalsNote" class="hint" hidden></p></section><p class="foot no-print">La validación GPS utiliza el dispositivo vinculado a cada recorrido y conserva el valor final hasta un recálculo explícito.</p></main><script src="/assets/trip-comparison.js"></script><script src="/assets/gps-comparison.js"></script><script src="/assets/common.js"></script><script src="/assets/auth.js"></script><script src="/assets/audit.js"></script>
